WEBVTT

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.680
BOY: All right, everyone!
This... is a stick-up!

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.560
Don't anybody move!

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:05.560
Now, empty that safe!

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.680
Ooh-hoo-hoo!
Money, money, money! (KISSING)

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.080
Stop it! Stop it,
you mean, old potato!

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.240
Quiet, Bo Peep,
or your sheep get run over!

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.400
Help! Baa!
Help us!

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:22.000
Oh, no, not my sheep!
Somebody do something!

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:31.480
VOICE BOX: Reach for the sky!

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.760
Oh, no! Sheriff Woody!

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:36.600
I'm here to stop you,
One-Eyed Bart.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:39.040
Doh!
How'd you know it was me?

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.840
Are you gonna come quietly?

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.080
You can't touch me, Sheriff!

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.480
I brought my attack dog
with the built-in force field.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:49.400
Well, I brought my dinosaur
who eats force-field dogs.

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:51.960
-(GROWLING)
-Yipe, yipe, yipe, yipe!

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.760
You're going to jail, Bart!

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.960
Say goodbye to the wife
and Tater Tots.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.040
(GIGGLING EXCITEDLY)

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:01.120
(LAUGHING)

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:05.120
(BABY SQUEALING,
LAUGHING, COOING)

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.600
You saved the day again, Woody.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.200
VOICE BOX: You're my
favorite deputy.

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.800
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.320
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.640
Come on,
let's wrangle up the cattle.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:21.960
♪ When the road looks
rough ahead

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.720
♪ And you're miles and miles
from your nice, warm bed

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.080
Round 'em up, cowboy!

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.920
♪ Just remember
what your old pal said

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.960
♪ Boy, you've got
a friend in me

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.080
Yee-haw!

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:37.000
♪ Yeah, you've got a friend in me

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.040
Hey, cowboy!

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.480
♪ Some other folks might be
a little bit smarter than I am

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.080
(WHINNYING)

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.920
♪ Big and stronger too

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.000
Come on, Woody.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.120
♪ Maybe

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:52.400
♪ But none of them will ever
love you the way I do

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.960
-♪ It's me and you, boy
-(LAUGHS)

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.320
♪ And as the years go by

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.480
Whoa! Whoa! (LAUGHING)

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:01.360
♪ Our friendship will never die

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:03.720
Whoo!

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.640
♪ You're gonna see
It's our destiny

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.040
(LAUGHING)

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.720
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:10.960
All right!

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.200
♪ Yeah, you've got a friend in me

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:14.800
Score!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.520
-♪ You got a friend in me ♪
-Wow! Cool!

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.680
-MOM: What do you think?
-Oh, this looks great, Mom!

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.120
Okay, birthday boy...

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.200
We saw that at the store!
I asked you for it!

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:27.040
-I hope I have enough places.
-Wow, look at that! That's so...

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.040
-One, two... Four.
-Oh, my gosh, you got...

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:31.880
-Yeah, I think that's gonna be enough.
-Could we leave this up 'til we move?

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.880
-Well, sure! We can leave it up.
-Yeah!

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:36.000
Now go get Molly. Your friends
are gonna be here any minute.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.720
Okay. It's party time, Woody.

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:42.560
-Yee-haw!
-(RUNNING FOOTFALLS)

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.000
(BABY SQUEALING)

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.000
Howdy, little lady.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.000
(SQUEALING)

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.040
VOICE BOX: Somebody's
poisoned the water hole.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.040
-(COOING)
-Come on, Molly.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.320
Oh, you're getting heavy.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:02.040
-(MOLLY COOING)
-See you later, Woody.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:03.920
(DOOR CLOSES)

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.600
Pull my string!
The birthday party's today?

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.600
Okay, everybody,
coast is clear!

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:26.760
-(SQUEAKS)
-Ages 3 and up. It's on my box.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:30.760
Ages 3 and up. I'm not supposed
to be baby-sitting Princess Drool.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.080
(TIRES SQUEAL, MOTOR REVS)

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:40.800
-(LITTLE TIKES GIBBERING)
-(BELL DINGS, SIREN WAILING)

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.960
-(SIREN WAILING)
-Hey, Hamm.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.160
-Look, I'm Picasso!
-I don't get it.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:51.800
You uncultured swine! What're
you lookin' at, ya hockey puck?

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.360
(SQUEAKS)

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.120
(LITTLE TIKES GIBBERING)

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.960
-Hey, Sarge, have you seen Slinky?
-Sir! No, sir!

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.960
Okay. Hey, thank you. At ease.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.680
-(SIREN WAILING)
-Hey, uh, Slinky?

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:07.640
Right here, Woody.
I'm red this time.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.880
-No. S-Slink...
-Oh, well, all right.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.160
You can be red if you want.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.240
Not now, Slink. I got some bad news.

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:14.320
(SHOUTS) Bad news?

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.280
Shh, shh, shh!

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:18.640
Just gather everyone up
for a staff meeting, and be happy.

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:19.680
Got it.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.920
-Be happy!
-Ha, ha, ha, ha!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.720
Staff meeting, everybody!
Snake, Robot, podium duty.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:25.840
(SIREN WAILING)

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.080
Hey. (JABBERS)

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.840
Hey, Etch. Draw!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.000
-(DING)
-Oh! Got me again.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:39.760
Etch, you've been working on that draw.
Fastest knobs in the West.

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:42.840
Got a staff meeting, you guys.
Come on, let's go.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.560
Now, where is that... Oh.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:48.160
Hey, who moved my doodle pad
way over here?

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:49.920
(ROARING)

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.840
-How're you doin', Rex?
-Were you scared? Tell me honestly.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.800
I was close to being scared
that time.

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:59.440
I'm going for fearsome here,
but I just don't feel it.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.840
I think I'm just
coming off as annoying.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:05.520
(COUGHS)
Ow! Oh, hi, Bo. Hi.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:08.200
I wanted to thank you, Woody,
for saving my flock.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:11.040
Oh, hey, it was, uh, nothin'.

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:15.360
What do you say I get someone else
to watch the sheep tonight?

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:18.560
(SHEEPISH GIGGLE)
Oh, yeah! (MUTTERS)

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:23.080
Remember, I'm just
a couple of blocks away.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.960
-Yodel-ay-hee-hoo!
-Come on, come on.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.360
Smaller toys up front.

